issue(id="0026" status="review")
  title Install the workspace CLI at the repository root
  user-story
    as-a Repository contributor.
    i-want The root development dependencies to include the local puggers CLI.
    so-that Root package-manager commands resolve the workspace package.
  premise.
    The repository root should depend on puggers through workspace:* and record
    the local package link in pnpm-lock.yaml.
  acceptance-criteria
    criterion Root devDependencies declares puggers as workspace:*.
    criterion The root lockfile importer links puggers to packages/puggers.
    criterion A frozen lockfile-only install succeeds without changing the lockfile.
  review-items
    item(status="open") Review the root dependency and lockfile link.
